  "proof": [
    "EntitySpawner cold branch instances+inits without respawn; pooled branch calls respawn. Dimetrodon.respawn resets Jump, whose fresh timer/landing timer are0 but reset timers2/1.",
    "Fresh cold first landing remains locked for its landing frame and unlocks next step because landing timer is initially0; following landings have1second pause.",
    "Jump captures a point once, waits0.5seconds and moves for1.5seconds. Height250px shifts original global y, represented by source screen-plane z in Roblox; ground point retained separately.",
    "Rise/fall share0.5 and negative-curve Math.ease(t,-3) from officialGodot3.5.3 source retained; no symmetric-sine substitute or leftover-delta second transition.",
    "No direct50damage/radius180AOE is implemented by source _land; it calls landShoot.shoot. Source facts keep those unused exports visible.",
    "Edge band samples original integer300\u00b1100 once; EDGE_MAP_DIST64 gives32px inner sampler margin. Corner side precedence and strict coin>0.5 preserved.",
    "NONE orderBottom/Right/Left/Top, reversed bottom interval, zero-vector sentinel and inclusive radial arrival preserved. Both max_target_distance vector coordinates are overwritten in source, so no invented distance limit."
  ],
